WEBVTT

00:05:29.671 --> 00:05:32.686
carqalada ayaana idin hor taalo, sida anaga oo kale.

00:05:32.686 --> 00:05:36.114
Midkeenaba nolosha kama guulesto

00:05:36.114 --> 00:05:39.759
qalbi jab la aan,

00:05:39.759 --> 00:05:42.039
Jaha-wareer la aan,

00:05:42.039 --> 00:05:44.997
hadii aad aaminsantahay oo aadna iiman leedahay

00:05:44.997 --> 00:05:47.393
waa guul dareesan kartaa hadana waa kasoo kaban kartaa

00:05:47.393 --> 00:05:50.318
oo aad aamin san tahay mintidnimo

00:05:50.318 --> 00:05:53.848
si qof karti leh,

00:05:53.848 --> 00:05:56.714
waad guuleysan, Bonnie aya mar dhankeyga aheyd,

00:05:56.714 --> 00:06:01.254
ayadoo i dhahaysay," Nakeen aan Florida aadno."